steps.body:
"this" ∈ A, so using the old sets:
- A − B = {this, that} − {that, other} = {this}
- B − C = {that, other} − {other, this} = {that}
- C − A = {other, this} − {this, that} = {other}

"that" ∈ B = {that}, so:
- C ∪ A = {other} ∪ {this} = {other, this}
- A ∪ B = {this} ∪ {that} = {this, that}
- B ∪ C = {that} ∪ {other} = {that, other}

Now A = {this, other}, B = {this, that}, C = {that, other}.

"other" ∈ C, so the loop continues; "this" ∈ A, so:
- A − B = {this, other} − {this, that} = {other}
- B − C = {this, that} − {that, other} = {this}
- C − A = {that, other} − {this, other} = {that}

animation.code:
A={"this","that"}
B={"that","other"}
C={"other","this"}
while "other" in C:
    if "this" in A:
        A,B,C=A-B,B-C,C-A
    if "that" in B:
        A,B,C=C|A,A|B,B|C
